1. Definitions & Scope

   a) "SDK Components" means all headless software development kits and shared
      libraries under the `packages/` directory of this repository, including
      without limitation `@jiange/collab`, `@jiange/doc-sdk`,
      `@jiange/sheet-sdk`, `@jiange/slides-sdk`, `@jiange/whiteboard-sdk`, and
      `@jiange/ooxml`.

   b) "Application Components" means all software, source code, configurations,
      and product assets in this repository outside the SDK Components,
      including without limitation `apps/` (web application), `server/`
      (backend and sync server), and deployment configurations.

